Q[7822]={p="Si tienes las sesenta piezas de tela mágica encima y estás $glisto:lista; para donarlas, puedes hacerlo ahora.",pEN="Mageweave is running low, and we could use your help to replenish our stocks! By counting on the community as a whole, we would only need a donation of 60 pieces of mageweave cloth from you to enable us to reach our goal. Such generosity would not go unnoticed by Thunder Bluff, I assure you!\n\nIf you have the sixty pieces of mageweave cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.",c="¡Maravilloso! ¡Te agradecemos tu generosa donación, $n!",cEN="Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, <name>!"}
