Q[8942]={d="Has demostrado ser muy de fiar, $n. Sé que me ayudarás en esto, y creo que la recompensa debe ser acorde con el servicio prestado.\n\nPor el momento, cambiaré tu cinturón y tus guanteletes. Si salimos de esta, te daré las piezas restantes.",dEN="You've proven to be a very reliable individual, <name>. As much as I trust that you'll help me through this predicament, it would be wise of me to reward you according to your performance.\n\nFor now I will exchange your belt and gauntlets. If we both see this through I shall make the rest of the pieces available to you.",o="Lleva 1 cordón y 1 par de guanteletes de elementos a Mokvar a Orgrimmar.|n",oEN="Bring a Cord of Elements and a set of Gauntlets of Elements to Mokvar in Orgrimmar.",p="¿Estás $glisto:lista; para comerciar?",pEN="You're ready to perform the exchange?",c="Nuestro acuerdo sigue vigente. Solo recuerda, esto es solo una muestra de lo que te espera. Líbrame de este destino maldito y te recompensaré con objetos de un poder verdaderamente grandioso.",cEN="Our agreement remains in place. Just remember, this is but a taste of what awaits you. Free me of this cursed fate and I will reward you with items of truly great power."}
