Q[10729]={c="¿Tienes clara tu elección, $n? No debes decidirlo a la ligera.\n\nEl sello Violeta aumentará su poder según demuestres tu valía a El Ojo Violeta.",cEN="Are you certain of your choice, <name>? This is not a decision you ought to take lightly.\n\nThe Violet Signet will grow in power as you continue to prove yourself to the Violet Eye."}
