Q[10738]={d="No nos has decepcionado, $n. Aún tenemos grandes esperanzas depositadas en ti.\n\nSigue sirviendo a El Ojo Violeta y recibirás tu recompensa.",dEN="You have not disappointed us, <name>. We continue to have very high hopes for you, however.\n\nContinue to serve the Violet Eye and you will be appropriately rewarded.",o="Entrega tu sello Violeta a la archimaga Leryda en el Paso de la Muerte tras obtener reputación venerado con El Ojo Violeta.",oEN="Bring your Violet Signet to Archmage Leryda at Deadwind Pass after obtaining Revered reputation with the Violet Eye.",c="Tus servicios no han pasado desapercibidos, $n. Tu sello puede parecer igual, pero sus poderes aumentan a medida que continúas demostrando tu lealtad.",cEN="Your services have not gone unnoticed, <name>. Your signet may look the same, but its powers grow as you continue to prove your loyalty."}
Q[10739]={d="No nos has decepcionado, $n. Aún tenemos grandes esperanzas depositadas en ti.\n\nSigue sirviendo a El Ojo Violeta y recibirás tu recompensa.",dEN="You have not disappointed us, <name>. We continue to have very high hopes for you, however.\n\nContinue to serve the Violet Eye and you will be appropriately rewarded.",o="Entrega tu sello Violeta a la archimaga Leryda en el Paso de la Muerte tras obtener reputación venerado con El Ojo Violeta.",oEN="Bring your Violet Signet to Archmage Leryda at Deadwind Pass after obtaining Revered reputation with the Violet Eye.",c="Tus servicios no han pasado desapercibidos, $n. Tu sello puede parecer igual, pero sus poderes aumentan a medida que continúas demostrando tu lealtad.",cEN="Your services have not gone unnoticed, <name>. Your signet may look the same, but its powers grow as you continue to prove your loyalty."}
